# Keep these LF in the repository no matter what the committer's platform is.
# A CRLF shebang or Dockerfile breaks the container build / shell scripts
# (`/bin/sh^M`, `--port "8000^M"`), and this project is developed on Windows
# where core.autocrlf is often true.
*.sh            text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.dockerfile    text eol=lf
docker-compose* text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
Makefile        text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
*.ini           text eol=lf
